#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.for_new_player.header"
msgstr "Letter to a New Farmer"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.for_new_player.content"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to our farming and gardening community!\n"
"\n"
"My name is Korney Korneich — I am the mayor of Zarechie and, by the way, a "
"professional gardener.\n"
"\n"
"I would like to congratulate you on starting this new chapter of life here "
"in our town. To celebrate this occasion, I’ve prepared a modest gift to help "
"you begin your journey. \n"
"\n"
"Wishing you success and a bountiful harvest! I’ll write again soon with more "
"updates."

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.for_new_player.signature"
msgstr "With respect, Mayor Korney Korneich"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.public_well_announcement_header"
msgstr "Public Well Announcement"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.public_well_announcement_content"
msgstr ""
"Dear residents of Zarechie,\n"
"\n"
"I am pleased to inform you that a public well has been constructed in our "
"city. Access to the well is free and available 24/7. \n"
"\n"
"You may use it to collect water using containers of various sizes, such as "
"buckets, watering cans, or other tools. \n"
"\n"
"We kindly ask that you maintain order and show respect for this shared "
"community resource. \n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your attention!"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.korney_korneich.signature"
msgstr "Mayor Korney Korneich"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.gardener_dobrynya"
msgstr "Gardener Dobrynya"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.reminder_season_header"
msgstr "Reminder"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.reminder_season_description_spring_->_summer"
msgstr ""
"Hi there! Quick reminder — summer starts tomorrow! Make sure to harvest all "
"your ripe crops before they go to waste!"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.reminder_season_description_summer_->_autumn"
msgstr ""
"Hey! The weather forecast predicts a cold snap tomorrow! To save your crops, "
"harvest everything ripe. Also, stop by my shop for autumn seeds!"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.reminder_season_description_autumn_->_winter"
msgstr ""
"Hello! The thermometer’s hitting below zero! Harvest all ripe crops, prep "
"livestock feed, and stoke the fireplace — winter’s here!"

#: assets/localizations/local.gd
msgid "letter.reminder_season_description_winter_->_spring"
msgstr ""
"Hi! Great news — the warm weather’s coming! Starting tomorrow, I’ll have "
"spring seeds available for purchase!"

